ng from the Donghu as a western branch of the Xianbei people, sharing common roots with the Tuoba tribe. In the early 3rd century, their chieftain Tufa Pigu led the tribe from Mount Yin north of the frontier to the Hexi region. In the late Three Kingdoms period, their tribe was relocated by Deng Ai to the border of Yong and Liang provinces. In the Western Jin dynasty, their chieftain Tufa Shujineng launched a massive rebellion against Jin. During the Sixteen Kingdoms period, Tufa Wugu established the Southern Liang state."},"talent":{"military":"8","commerce":"2","politics":"5"}}],"friendGroups":[],"body":{"name":"秃发匹孤","height":"平均","shape":"精壮"},"honorifics":[],"selfAddress":[],"specialNames":[],"vip":{"isVIP":0,"from":"0","to":"0"},"marriage":{"aiMarriageAge":"25","startPregnantAge":"0"},"scenarios":[{"story":{"id":"S10802","name":{"zh":"黄巾起义","en":"Yellow Turban Rebellion"},"year":"184","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[83,77,62,61,73,87],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10215","name":{"zh":"汉末三杰","en":"Three Heroes of the Late Han"},"year":"185","month":"3"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[83,77,62,61,73,87],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"3150","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10615","name":{"zh":"十常侍之乱","en":"Turmoil of the Ten Attendants"},"year":"188","month":"11"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1076","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[83,77,62,61,73,87],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"80","reputation":"3400","equipment":{"weapon":"WP13002","armor":"WP1002205","helmet":"WP1023705","horse":"WP1001015"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10402","name":{"zh":"诸